Farmati Hai Yeh Hazrat-e-Salma Jigar Figar<br>
EK Roz Mere Khwab Me Aaye Falak Weqar<br>
Chehra Tha Zard Ranj Se Aankhen Thi Aashkbar<br>
Aamama Tha Gaale Me Padhi Sar Pe Thi Ghubar<br>
Maine Kaha Tadhap Ke Aaye Sultan-e-Ambiyan<br>
Yeh Haal Kaisa Apne Apna Bana Liya<br>
Kaisi Padhi Howi Hai Yeh Chehre Pe Khakh-o-Dhool<br>
Hathou Se Muh Ku Peet Ke khene Lage Rasool<br>
<br>
Umme Salma Hussain Maragaya<br>
Kund Kanjar Se Sar Utara Gaya<br>
<br>
1.Aaraha Hu Zameen-e-Karbal Se<br>
Chain Sabro Kharar Saara Gaya<br>
<br>
2.Jisse Roushan Thi Meri Binayi<br>
Meri Aakhou Ka Wo Sitara Gaya<br>
<br>
3.Rota Zehra Ku Chodh Aaya Hu<br>
Mujhse Dekha Na Wo Nazara Gaya<br>
<br>
4.Teen Din Ka Wo Bhuka Pyasa Tha<br>
Jis Ghadi Tan Se Sar Utara Gaya<br>
<br>
5.Jisku Apni Zuban Chusata Tha<br>
Pyasa Duniya Se Wo Dulara Gaya<br>
<br>
6.Meri Bachi Ghar Gowa Barbat<br>
Aaye Musalmano Kya Tumhara Gaya<br>
<br>
7.Sau Jaaga Se Jo Chakh Tha Kurta<br>
Khech Kar Jism Se Utara Gaya<br>
<br>
8.Teer Se Bhi Jo Khath Me Chota Tha<br>
Muskurata Howa Wo Pyara Gaya
